    "On RTMP they are added to the stream key. Optional: when both are empty, the slug and key are enough." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su RTMP finiscono nella stream key. Facoltativi: se sono entrambi vuoti bastano slug e key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On RTSP they are added to the URL query. Optional: when both are empty, the slug and key are enough." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su RTSP finiscono nella query dell’URL. Facoltativi: se sono entrambi vuoti bastano slug e key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On SRT they are added to the streamid. Optional: when both are empty, the slug and key are enough." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
